The constructor at line 350–361 reads the current OS username via `os.userInfo().username` and constructs:

```
this.socketPath = `/tmp/tauri-mcp-o8-${username}.sock`;
```

The token path is then derived from it:

```
this.tokenPath = `${this.socketPath}.token`;
// → /tmp/tauri-mcp-o8-${username}.sock.token
```
